  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "JOAL 是 JogAmp 项目下的 Java OpenAL 绑定库，将 OpenAL C API 封装为 Java 接口（AL/ALC/ALExt），支持硬件加速的 3D 空间化音频。同时提供 Sound3D 高层面向对象工具包（Device/Context/Source/Buffer/Listener），以及 ALAudioSink 音频输出和 WAVLoader 解码工具。底层通过 GlueGen 自动生成 JNI 胶水代码，并捆绑自建的 OpenAL-Soft 原生库。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "OpenAL 低层绑定",
        "description": "将 OpenAL C API（AL、ALC、ALExt）完整映射为 Java 接口，包括函数指针表、扩展查询和常量定义",
        "evidence": [
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/ALFactory.java",
          "make/stub_includes/openal/al.h",
          "make/stub_includes/openal/alc.h"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Sound3D 高层工具包",
        "description": "面向对象的 3D 音频 API，封装 Device、Context、Source、Buffer、Listener 等概念，提供直观的音频环境搭建与操控",
        "evidence": [
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/sound3d/AudioSystem3D.java",
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/sound3d/Source.java",
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/sound3d/Device.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "音频输出与解码",
        "description": "ALAudioSink 实现 AudioSink 接口用于流式音频播放，WAVLoader 解码 WAV 文件，SimpleSineSynth 生成正弦波测试音",
        "evidence": [
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/util/ALAudioSink.java",
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/util/WAVLoader.java",
          "src/java/com/jogamp/openal/util/SimpleSineSynth.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "JNI 原生胶水代码",
        "description": "通过 GlueGen 从 C 头文件自动生成的 Java→C 绑定代码，以及手写的 almisc.c 辅助函数（alGetProcAddress 调度、alcGetString 特殊处理）",
        "evidence": [
          "src/native/almisc.c",
          "make/config/joal-al-CustomJavaCode.java",
          "make/config/joal-alc-impl-CustomCCode.c"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "音频/多媒体",
    "target_users": "需要在 Java 应用中实现 3D 空间化音频的开发者，尤其是游戏、仿真和多媒体应用开发者"
  },
